## Design
A `TagFilter` is a Vec of clauses (AND). Each clause is a Vec<String> (OR).
Parsing: split each --tag value by comma, normalize each tag name (strip @).
A yak matches if for every clause, it has at least one tag in that clause.

Tree display: two-pass approach:
1. First pass: mark which yaks match the tag filter (+ only filter)
2. Second pass: mark ancestors of matching yaks as "show for context"
3. Display: show matched yaks and context-only ancestors, skip the rest

